<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan transport firm profits fall.</title>
<headline>Moroccan transport firm profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Compagnie de Transports Au Maroc-Lignes Nationales posted net profits of 22 million dirhams ($2.3 million) in 1996 from 29.7 million dirhams in 1995.</p>
<p>Turnover for 1996 was 252 million dirhams from 245 million dirhams the year before.</p>
<p>Listed on the Casablanca stock exchange, the bus-network traded at 360 dirhams on March 31.</p>
<p>($1=9.3 dirhams)</p>
</text>
